 purchases of investments of $316.5 million, and a $70.7 million increase in capital expenditures related to the</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></div></div>
